  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the number of elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
